+This method is part of the voxel chunking pipeline for efficient mesh generation in voxel-based games and simulations. It is implemented in the `projekto` project by afonsolage, which focuses on efficient voxel data management and rendering [S1, unofficial]. The technique of chunk boundary wrapping is a common approach in voxel engines to decouple local processing from global scene structure.
 
